--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 417537591e290ed4cbe1c39452e3d179, type: 3}
  m_Name: Merchant_Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c58e49cd6037a9a4e87f9fa4d905feaa, type: 2}
    text: Hi. Are you okay?
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bae752d3182d29548bf4816039f958c1, type: 2}
    text: Hi. No. I cannot find my brother.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c58e49cd6037a9a4e87f9fa4d905feaa, type: 2}
    text: Oh no, I am sorry. Can I help you?
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bae752d3182d29548bf4816039f958c1, type: 2}
    text: How can you help me?
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c58e49cd6037a9a4e87f9fa4d905feaa, type: 2}
    text: Some penguins went to Highlands, maybe your brother is there?
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bae752d3182d29548bf4816039f958c1, type: 2}
    text: Highlands? Where is it?
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c58e49cd6037a9a4e87f9fa4d905feaa, type: 2}
    text: It is in Scotland. It is beautiful there!
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bae752d3182d29548bf4816039f958c1, type: 2}
    text: How do I get there?
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c58e49cd6037a9a4e87f9fa4d905feaa, type: 2}
    text: 'Swim of course! If you look at the map, Kraken points at Scotland. '
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c58e49cd6037a9a4e87f9fa4d905feaa, type: 2}
    text: Okay, I will.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c58e49cd6037a9a4e87f9fa4d905feaa, type: 2}
    text: I can go with you and ask other birds if they saw anything.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bae752d3182d29548bf4816039f958c1, type: 2}
    text: Thank you! I will appreciate that.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c58e49cd6037a9a4e87f9fa4d905feaa, type: 2}
    text: Also, if you see litter, pick it up.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bae752d3182d29548bf4816039f958c1, type: 2}
    text: What? Why?
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c58e49cd6037a9a4e87f9fa4d905feaa, type: 2}
    text: I can give you accessories in return, just check "Items" page. And also,
      picking it up helps our Planet.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c58e49cd6037a9a4e87f9fa4d905feaa, type: 2}
    text: But be carefu. Some litter can be sharp, so if you can, ask adults to help
      you.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bae752d3182d29548bf4816039f958c1, type: 2}
    text: Okay, I will. So where do we go?
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c58e49cd6037a9a4e87f9fa4d905feaa, type: 2}
    text: Time to go to Scotland! Go to the left and jump.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bae752d3182d29548bf4816039f958c1, type: 2}
    text: Okay. Thank you!
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c58e49cd6037a9a4e87f9fa4d905feaa, type: 2}
    text: No problem. See you soon.
  options: []
